{"text": "Thank you for always ordering pies. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From our bakery. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For your special occasions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We truly appreciate your continued support. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And always try to provide. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Pies of the highest quality. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Unfortunately. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We are writing to inform you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That we are unable to prepare. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The apple pie you have ordered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the upcoming birthday celebration. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Due to a delayed apple harvest this season. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We are currently experiencing difficulties. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sourcing fresh apples. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As a result. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We are unable to fulfill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The order that you have requested. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We sincerely apologize. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For this situation. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We appreciate your understanding. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And look forward to serving you again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the future.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "n", "k", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", "l", "w", "a", "y", "s", " ", "o", "r", "d", "e", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "p", "i", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "r", "o", "m", " ", "o", "u", "r", " ", "b", "a", "k", "e", "r", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "s", "p", "e", "c", "i", "a", "l", " ", "o", "c", "c", "a", "s", "i", "o", "n", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "e", " ", "t", "r", "u", "l", "y", " ", "a", "p", "p", "r", "e",